# Hyperbolic hybrid: heptagons of unit sides with triangles and 14-gons whose sides are two edges, cut by a Pi
# point (Marek Čtrnáct's board 1.449074). Pi is a full vertex: A7 A7 Pi puts two heptagon corners on a long side.
